### Step 3: Generate Patch

Below is the patch to fix the bug. The main changes are:

- When searching for the node containing the image, also check if the image is inside an anchor, and treat the anchor as the node to move/apply stretch to.
- When moving the image, move the anchor (if present) instead of just the image.

